OL,3,GNEWSARoads, car parks and tips shut as
OL,4,AIronman returns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular triathlon race is returning
OL,7,Fto Dorset for its 10th year, with
OL,8,Fresidents warned of road, car park and
OL,9,Fhousehold tip closures.
OL,11,FIronman 70.3 Weymouth takes place on
OL,12,FSunday with competitors swimming 1.2
OL,13,Fmiles in Weymouth Bay, followed by a
OL,14,F56-mile bike ride to King's Stag via
OL,15,FPuddletown and Dorchester, and a 13.1
OL,16,Fmile run on Weymouth seafront.
OL,18,FThis year it will also include the
OL,19,Ffirst Ironkids event, with children
OL,20,Faged three to 15 running between 500m
OL,21,Fand 1.5km near the Pavilion, finishing
OL,22,Fon the red carpet.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
